<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Prithviraj Chauhan - The Great Rajput Warrior</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@400;700&family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>

*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
}

body{
    font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;
    background:linear-gradient(-45deg,#0f2027,#203a43,#2c5364,#1c1c1c);
    background-size:400% 400%;
    animation:bgMove 10s ease infinite;
    color:white;
    overflow-x:hidden;
}

@keyframes bgMove{
    0%{background-position:0% 50%;}
    50%{background-position:100% 50%;}
    100%{background-position:0% 50%;}
}

.hero{
    min-height:100vh;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    text-align:center;
    padding:40px;
}

.hero img{
    width:380px;
    height:450px;
    object-fit:cover;
    border-radius:25px;
    border:6px solid gold;
    box-shadow:0 0 40px gold;
    animation:float 4s ease-in-out infinite;
}

@keyframes float{
    0%{transform:translateY(0px);}
    50%{transform:translateY(-15px);}
    100%{transform:translateY(0px);}
}

.hero h1{
    font-size:5rem;
    margin-top:30px;
    color:#ffd700;
    font-family:'Cinzel',serif;
    text-shadow:0 0 20px gold;
    animation:fadeIn 2s ease;
}

.hero p{
    max-width:1000px;
    margin-top:25px;
    font-size:1.3rem;
    line-height:2;
    animation:fadeUp 2s ease;
}

@keyframes fadeIn{
    from{
        opacity:0;
        transform:translateY(-50px);
    }
    to{
        opacity:1;
        transform:translateY(0);
    }
}

@keyframes fadeUp{
    from{
        opacity:0;
        transform:translateY(50px);
    }
    to{
        opacity:1;
        transform:translateY(0);
    }
}

.section{
    padding:80px 10%;
}

.section h2{
    text-align:center;
    font-size:3.5rem;
    color:#ffd700;
    margin-bottom:50px;
    font-family:'Cinzel',serif;
}

.cards{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));
    gap:35px;
}

.card{
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
    border-radius:25px;
    padding:35px;
    transition:0.5s;
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
}

.card:hover{
    transform:translateY(-12px) scale(1.03);
    box-shadow:0 0 25px rgba(255,215,0,0.7);
}

.card h3{
    color:#ffd700;
    margin-bottom:20px;
    font-size:1.7rem;
}

.card p{
    line-height:1.9;
    font-size:1.05rem;
}

.timeline{
    margin-top:40px;
}

.timeline-item{
    margin-bottom:35px;
    padding:25px;
    border-left:5px solid gold;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius:10px;
    animation:fadeUp 2s ease;
}

.timeline-item h3{
    color:#ffd700;
    margin-bottom:10px;
}

.quote{
    text-align:center;
    padding:80px 20px;
    font-size:2.2rem;
    color:#fff3a3;
    font-style:italic;
    animation:pulse 3s infinite;
}

@keyframes pulse{
    0%{transform:scale(1);}
    50%{transform:scale(1.05);}
    100%{transform:scale(1);}
}

footer{
    background:rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    text-align:center;
    padding:25px;
    font-size:1rem;
}

</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="hero">

    <!-- WORKING IMAGE -->
    <img src="pc.jpg" alt="Prithviraj Chauhan">

    <h1>PRITHVIRAJ CHAUHAN</h1>

    <p>
        Prithviraj Chauhan was one of the greatest Rajput kings and warriors in Indian history.
        He ruled Ajmer and Delhi during the 12th century and became famous for his bravery,
        intelligence, leadership, and patriotism. He was known for his powerful army,
        excellent horse-riding skills, and unmatched archery. His courage and sacrifice
        made him a legendary hero of India.
    </p>

</div>

<section class="section">

    <h2>Major Achievements</h2>

    <div class="cards">

        <div class="card">
            <h3>King of Ajmer and Delhi</h3>
            <p>
                Prithviraj Chauhan became the ruler of Ajmer at a young age.
                Through his intelligence and military strength, he expanded his kingdom
                and later ruled Delhi, becoming one of the most powerful kings in North India.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Victory in First Battle of Tarain</h3>
            <p>
                In 1191, Prithviraj Chauhan defeated Muhammad Ghori in the First Battle of Tarain.
                This victory showed his extraordinary military strategies and bravery.
                His army protected India from foreign invasions during that time.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Master of Archery</h3>
            <p>
                According to legends, Prithviraj Chauhan had the special skill called
                “Shabd Bhedi Baan,” which means hitting a target only by hearing sound.
                This made him one of the most respected warriors in Indian history.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>

</section>

<section class="section">

    <h2>Bravery and Heroism</h2>

    <div class="cards">

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Fearless Warrior</h3>
            <p>
                Prithviraj Chauhan fought many battles bravely and never feared enemies.
                He always protected his kingdom, people, and culture with great courage.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Symbol of Rajput Pride</h3>
            <p>
                His life became a symbol of Rajput pride, honor, sacrifice, and patriotism.
                Even today, he is remembered as one of the bravest kings of India.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Inspirational Legacy</h3>
            <p>
                The stories of Prithviraj Chauhan inspire students and historians across India.
                His bravery teaches the importance of courage, self-respect, and love for the nation.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>

</section>

<section class="section">

    <h2>Life Timeline</h2>

    <div class="timeline">

        <div class="timeline-item">
            <h3>1149 CE - Birth</h3>
            <p>
                Prithviraj Chauhan was born into the Chauhan dynasty in Rajasthan.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="timeline-item">
            <h3>1177 CE - Became King</h3>
            <p>
                He became the ruler of Ajmer at a young age after the death of his father.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="timeline-item">
            <h3>1191 CE - Victory at Tarain</h3>
            <p>
                He defeated Muhammad Ghori in the First Battle of Tarain.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="timeline-item">
            <h3>Legacy</h3>
            <p>
                Prithviraj Chauhan is remembered forever as a brave Rajput warrior and hero of India.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>

</section>

<div class="quote">
    “A true warrior fights for honor, courage, and his motherland.”
</div>

<footer>
    Tribute to the Great Rajput King - Prithviraj Chauhan 🇮🇳
</footer>

</body>
</html>
